      "query": "mutation CreateDocumentMutation(\n  $document: DocumentInput!,\n  $signers: [SignerInput!]!,\n  $file: Upload!\n) {\n  createDocument(\n    document: $document,\n    signers: $signers,\n    file: $file\n  ) {\n    id\n    name\n    refusable\n    sortable\n    created_at\n    signatures {\n      public_id\n      name\n      email\n      created_at\n      action { name }\n      link { short_link }\n      user { id name email }\n    }\n  }\n}\n",
      "apiUrl": "https://api.autentique.com.br/v2/graphql",
      "variables": "{\n  \"document\": {\n    \"name\": \"Marketing contract\"\n  },\n  \"signers\": [{\n    \"email\": \"this-email-is-public-do-not-use-it@tuamaeaquelaursa.com\",\n    \"action\": \"SIGN\"\n  }]\n}",
